# Caddy reads the pre-issued TLS certificate from this directory (mounted at
# /certs). Place two files here on the server:
#   cert.pem  -> full chain   (acme.sh: ~/.acme.sh/<domain>_ecc/fullchain.cer)
#   key.pem   -> private key   (acme.sh: ~/.acme.sh/<domain>_ecc/<domain>.key)
# These are git-ignored; only this placeholder is tracked so the mount exists.
